d/us/texas-wildfire-jumps-creeks-and-rivers-as-powerful-winds-drive-rapid-spread/articleshow/133532518.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T12:15:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133532564,imgsize-117654.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Savannah audited 39,000 Flock searches and found 34 unjustified; 4 employees arrested]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133531276.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Four former Savannah Police Department employees have been arrested over alleged misuse of the Flock Safety license plate reader system. The arrests followed an internal audit of 39,000 searches, which flagged 127 for review and found 34 were unjustified. Six employees were fired, while the Georgia Bureau of Investigation continues to investigate the case.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/savannah-audited-39000-flock-searches-and-found-34-unjustified-6-employees-were-fired-and-4-have-now-been-arrested/articleshow/133531276.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/savannah-audited-39000-flock-searches-and-found-34-unjustified-6-employees-were-fired-and-4-have-now-been-arrested/articleshow/133531276.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T14:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133532297,imgsize-111697.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[San Francisco woman hires a $30-an-hour humanoid robot to clean her apartment]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133531086.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-francisco-woman-hires-a-humanoid-robot-for-30-an-hour-to-clean-her-apartment-while-controlling-it-remotely-from-her-sofa/articleshow/133531086.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-francisco-woman-hires-a-humanoid-robot-for-30-an-hour-to-clean-her-apartment-while-controlling-it-remotely-from-her-sofa/articleshow/133531086.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T11:33:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133531674,imgsize-1627660.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Japanese engineer’s anime-inspired hair helped test a driver safety camera]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133530388.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/japanese-engineers-anime-inspired-hair-was-meant-to-save-time-but-it-ended-up-testing-a-driver-safety-camera-and-now-holds-more-than-250-patents/articleshow/133530388.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/japanese-engineers-anime-inspired-hair-was-meant-to-save-time-but-it-ended-up-testing-a-driver-safety-camera-and-now-holds-more-than-250-patents/articleshow/133530388.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T13:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133531303,imgsize-85732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1,500-year-old child burial unearthed in Peru with whistles, rattle and vessel]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133530567.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Archaeologists found a 1,500-year-old infant burial in northern Peru.  The child was buried with whistles, a rattle, and a sculptural vessel.  This burial displays patterns characteristic of the ancient Moche culture.  The discovery occurred in a residential area, offering insights into daily life.  Excavations continue to expand understanding of the Moche community.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/1500-year-old-child-burial-unearthed-in-peru-with-whistles-a-rattle-and-a-striking-sculptural-vessel-archaeologists-uncover-clues-to-an-ancient-civilisations-rituals/articleshow/133530567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/1500-year-old-child-burial-unearthed-in-peru-with-whistles-a-rattle-and-a-striking-sculptural-vessel-archaeologists-uncover-clues-to-an-ancient-civilisations-rituals/articleshow/133530567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T11:20:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133531383,imgsize-2383820.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Seven dead, nine Chinese workers missing after fire at gas chemical complex in Russia]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133530964.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A fire at a gas chemical complex in Russia's Amur region has claimed seven lives. Six Chinese nationals were among the deceased in the Tuesday incident. Nine more Chinese workers are currently missing after the blaze. The fire broke out at the facility and was later extinguished. The plant's press service confirmed the tragic events occurred.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/seven-dead-nine-chinese-workers-missing-after-fire-at-gas-chemical-complex-in-russia/articleshow/133530964.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.in